"\n"
"For the on-screen keyboard, to use CTRL or ESC keys,\n"
"touch key once to enable it then touch the desired letter key."
msgstr ""
"{{keyMod}}B Starten             {{arrowMod}}1 1 MHz (Normal)\n"
"{{keyMod}}C Bildschirm kopieren {{arrowMod}}2 2 MHz\n"
"{{keyMod}}O Zustand öffnen      {{arrowMod}}3 3 MHz\n"
"{{keyMod}}R Zurücksetzen        {{arrowMod}}4 4 MHz (Schnell)\n"
